76947,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bKtqT","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T21:54:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T21:54:29Z","body":"I can't reproduce this on 4.4.beta1.\n\n<details open>\n\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\n\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\n</details>\n\nThe benchmark completes very fast, so even `watch -n0.1 \"free -m && nvidia-smi\"` has trouble keeping up (and `watch` doesn't allow values below `0.1`). I did try running 10 instances of the benchmarks simultaneously to increase VRAM usage, but regardless of this, 4.3.stable and 4.4.beta1 will peak at similar memory utilizations (within margin of error).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603276947/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2610695551","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101850#issuecomment-2610695551","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101850","id":2610695551,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bnA1_","user":{"login":"NovaXP","id":19160556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwNTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP","html_url":"https://github.com/NovaXP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-23T18:43:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-23T18:43:22Z","body":"I'm currently testing this on as many other devices as I can and will report back with my findings.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2610695551/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611771863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101850#issuecomment-2611771863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101850","id":2611771863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6brHnX","user":{"login":"NovaXP","id":19160556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwNTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP","html_url":"https://github.com/NovaXP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T07:20:08Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T07:20:08Z","body":"I did some tests using Libre Hardware Monitor to get actual numbers instead of just Task Manager screenshots, and initially I found that the amount of VRAM being used between 4.3 and 4.4 were very similar, enough that'd I'd consider it margin of error.\n\nHowever, something that clearly varied between the results of 4.3 and 4.4 was the amount of _shared_ GPU memory being used, where 4.3 was using much more than 4.4.\n\n### Shared GPU Memory Used (averages from multiple tests):\n\n**Radeon R9 M265X (2 GB):**\n4.3 - 286.96 MB\n4.4 - 51.26 MB\n\n**GTX 1060 (6 GB):**\n4.3 - 374.43 MB\n4.4 - 122.13 MB\n\n**RTX 4070 (12 GB):**\n4.3 - 439.68 MB\n4.4 - 179.77 MB\n\n**Ryzen 7 4700G (512 MB):**\n4.3 - 1598.55 MB\n4.4 - 1242.95 MB\n\n**GTX 650 Ti (1 GB):**\n4.3 - 1083.75 MB\n4.4 - All tests crashed with \"ERROR: Can't allocate memory for image, error: -2\"\n<br>\n\nThe GTX 1060 and 4700G were on Windows 11, the rest were on Windows 10. I did all the tests one after another and made sure there weren't any unnecessary background programs running for any of them.\n\nI'm afraid I'm not familiar enough with the inner workings of the engine to know what might be causing this, but I can provide screenshots of the data I got from any of the tests, and can try to scrounge up from other systems if it'd help.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611771863/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613081853","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101850#issuecomment-2613081853","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101850","id":2613081853,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bwHb9","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T17:49:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T17:49:54Z","body":"I wonder if this makes a difference https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101972\n\nWe were requesting the wrong memory type for certain buffers, I wonder if that triggered GPU drivers to allocate memory inefficiently. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613081853/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613115324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101850#issuecomment-2613115324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101850","id":2613115324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bwPm8","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T18:10:11Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T18:10:11Z","body":"> I wonder if this makes a difference https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101972\n\nFix #101972 could strongly be related; since we were wrongly allocating almost all memory into VRAM, whereas some of that memory was supposed to be allocated in normal RAM (which is normally a lot more abundant) and be accessed over PCIe bus.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613115324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613789442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101850#issuecomment-2613789442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101850","id":2613789442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6by0MC","user":{"login":"NovaXP","id":19160556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwNTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP","html_url":"https://github.com/NovaXP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NovaXP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T05:24:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T05:24:13Z","body":"I downloaded the Windows Editor artifact from that pull request on the 650 Ti and M265X computers from my previous test and the results were the same as with 4.4 Beta 1. I'm admittedly a bit new to using GitHub, so if that wasn't the right way to get it then let me know and I'll try again.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://ap